meta {
  name: BorrowingController
  seq: 6
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Every endpoint in this folder is librarian or admin. A student signed in gets 403 on
  all four, including the reads:

    GET   /borrowings              librarian, admin
    GET   /borrowings/{copyId}     librarian, admin
    POST  /borrowings              librarian, admin
    POST  /borrowings/{id}/return  librarian, admin

  `getAllBorrowings` lists the whole school and `getBorrowingByCopyId` names whoever is
  holding a copy, so neither can be opened to students as it stands. The endpoint a
  student is supposed to call — "my borrowings" — does not exist yet (access rules §7).
}
